WEBVTT

00:02:58.976 --> 00:03:02.468
without a male escort.

00:03:02.468 --> 00:03:07.843
She is confined under the four walls of her home.

00:03:07.843 --> 00:03:13.037
She is no more a free individual.

00:03:13.037 --> 00:03:16.057
She becomes the so-called honor

00:03:16.057 --> 00:03:18.538
of her father and of her brothers

00:03:18.538 --> 00:03:21.988
and of her family,

00:03:21.988 --> 00:03:24.676
and if she transgresses

00:03:24.676 --> 00:03:27.887
the code of that so-called honor,

00:03:27.887 --> 00:03:32.251
she could even be killed.